    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nREA Donohoe Spring are delighted to bring to the market this Spacious Well Presented Ground Floor, 2 Bed Apartment Overlooking Woodford Canal in Popular Residential Development. Walking Distance to All Amenities. Ideal Home or Investment. For Sale by Private Treaty.\n\n \n\nThe well laid out living accommodation extends to C. 80m2 /c. 850 sq. ft. comprises of:\n\nEntrance Hallway (4.0 x 2.0) with alcove for closet, Hot Press, Living Room (5.0 x 4.4) with electric fireplace and patio doors to covered balcony (4.0 x 1.5), Kitchen/Diner (3.3 x 3.2), Bedroom 1 (3.6 x 3.5) with En-suite (2.4 x 1.5), Bedroom 2 (3.9 x 3.0) Bathroom (2.4 x 2.1).\n\n \n\nThe apartment enjoys scenic views over the Woodford Canal (Shannon-Erne Blueway). \n\n \n\nThis apartment is presented to market in good condition throughout and is serviced by; Electric storage heating (night metre), mains services and located in high speed fibre area.\n\n \n\nRussell Quay is a secure well maintained development with large green common space and ample parking. There is an active Management Company in place annual management fee of 1552.22 (includes waste disposal). BER: D1.\n\n \n\nAn ideal property for first time buyers, those looking to downsize, holiday retreat or \"buy to let\" investment.\n\n \n\nLocated walking distance to all amenities in Ballyconnell including shops, restaurants, bars, schools and C. 3km to The Slieve Russell Hotel Golf Club. C. 20m mins to a wide range of amenities in Cavan Town and approx. 30 mins to Enniskillen. Approx. 2 hour drive to Dublin Belfast. GPS: 54.113842, -7.585528.\n\nViewing Highly Recommended By Appointment Only \n\n"
      },
